<title>INDONESIA: TABLE-Tempo Scan first half net edges up.</title>
<headline>TABLE-Tempo Scan first half net edges up.</headline>
<dateline>JAKARTA 1997-08-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to June 30</p>
<p>			    (in billion rupiah except per share)</p>
<p>    Net income			28.32	  vs    24.79</p>
<p>    Earnings per share  (rph)    189	   vs     165</p>
<p>    Net sales			291.23	  vs   224.07</p>
<p>    Gross profit		   127.83	  vs   101.28</p>
<p>    Operating income	     44.95	   vs    35.19</p>
<p>    Pre-tax profit		 36.08	   vs    33.44</p>
<p>    Retained earnings	    117.25	  vs    80.26</p>
<p>NOTE: The consolidated results were unaudited. PT Tempo Scan Pacific is a pharmaceutical firm.</p>
